\begin_layout Standard
Even AlphaGo, as a prestige project of the RL, supervised by a research
 team, was subject to errors of reasoning.
 Especially in sensitive areas such as industry, a tradeoff in favor of
 performance at the expense of loss of control is often not an option, since
 even rarely occurring wrong decisions could have fatal consequences.
 In view of the increasing importance of algorithms in our society, the
 EU has even defined a right to explain in the GDPR.
 These are the reasons why explainable artificial intelligence (XAI) has
 become more and more popular in recent years.
