reference "subsec:Fixed-nodes"

\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
In addition to the TED, fixed nodes have been defined to bind the GP process
 even more closely to the preferences of the developer.
 Especially if the developer is sure of the correctness of his abstraction
 at this point, pointless attempts of the GP process to optimise at these
 points can be prevented as performance and security reasons.
\end_layout

