\begin_layout Standard
In 
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand cite
key "xiao2019"
literal "true"

\end_inset

, a close-form preset policy was proposed, defining a lower and upper bound
 for the car to determine the actions.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{multline*}
min(-0.09(position+0.25)^{2}+0.03,0.3(position+0.09)^{4}-0.008)\leq\\
\leq velocity\leq\\
\leq(-0.07(position+0.38)^{2}+0.07)
\end{multline*}

\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
With 36 nodes, this expert program already has an enormous natural tree
 size, which means that the TED does not lose its effect even with relatively
 large changes.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Thus two essential improvements could be found here.
 On the one hand, it was recognized that the upper limit has no meaning
 for the MC experiment.
 In the second case, a small change has led to an enormous improvement.
 This improvement is even better than the Sarsa-75 policy in the real experiment.
\end_layout

